---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy - ArceApps">
  <div class="bg-surface-subtle py-16 dark:bg-dark-surface-subtle md:py-20">
    <!-- Language Toggle -->
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 mb-8 flex justify-center">
      <div class="inline-flex gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-1.5 shadow-sm dark:border-dark-border dark:bg-dark-surface-raised">
        <a href="/es/cookies" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant dark:text-dark-on-surface-variant hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:outline-none">
          🇪🇸 Español
        </a>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white font-medium shadow-sm cursor-default">
          🇺🇸 English
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-on-surface dark:text-dark-on-surface">Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant dark:text-dark-on-surface-variant">Last updated: August 12, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-slate dark:prose-invert mx-auto rounded-[2rem] border border-border bg-surface-raised p-6 shadow-xl shadow-primary/5 dark:border-dark-border dark:bg-dark-surface-raised md:p-10 prose-a:focus-visible:ring-2 prose-a:focus-visible:ring-primary prose-a:focus-visible:outline-none prose-a:rounded-sm">
        <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that websites store in your browser. They are used for many purposes: remembering
          preferences, keeping you logged in, or measuring how a website is used.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies used on this website</h2>
        <p>
          This website is free, ad-free, and does not use any third-party analytics, advertising, personalization or
          tracking cookies. The only cookies it sets are strictly functional: they remember your preferences (theme and
          language) and the fact that you have already seen and dismissed the cookie notice.
        </p>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Cookie</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
              <th>Duration</th>
              <th>Provider</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>cookie-consent</code></td>
              <td>Remembers that you have dismissed the cookie notice</td>
              <td>Persistent (localStorage)</td>
              <td>ArceApps (this site)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>theme</code></td>
              <td>Remembers your light/dark theme preference</td>
              <td>Persistent (localStorage)</td>
              <td>ArceApps (this site)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>
          Language preference is encoded in the URL (e.g. <code>/blog/...</code> for English, <code>/es/blog/...</code> for
          Spanish) and is not stored in a cookie.
        </p>

        <h2>Your consent</h2>
        <p>
          When you visit this website for the first time, a brief notice at the bottom of the page informs you that the
          site uses functional cookies and lets you dismiss it. No data is collected before or after that interaction:
          closing the notice is the only action you need to take. Your choice is stored in your own browser
          (<code>localStorage</code>, key <code>cookie-consent</code>), and the notice will not be shown again on that
          device.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site has never used advertising, user-data, or personalization signals. Nothing is sold to third parties
          and no sensitive data is collected.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          None. This site does not embed analytics, advertising, social widgets, fonts, or any other resource from a
          third-party domain. All scripts, styles, fonts, and images are served from <code>arceapps.com</code> (or its
          static-asset CDN at <code>cdn.simpleicons.org</code> for technology icons).
        </p>

        <h2>How to change or withdraw your consent</h2>
        <p>
          You can reset the notice at any time by clearing the <code>cookie-consent</code> entry in your browser's
          <code>localStorage</code> (or all site data) for this website. The notice will then appear again on your
          next visit.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this cookie policy, please use the
          <a href="/about-me#contact">contact form</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl border border-primary/20">
          <p>
            © Arce Apps<br />
            Madrid - Spain
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
